    {
      "scene": 1,
      "tone": "hook",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/01.wav",
      "start": 21.65,
      "dur": 26.5,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 25.3,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "You have heard it your whole life.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.6,
          "abs_start": 21.99
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Islam was spread by the sword.",
          "start": 1.94,
          "dur": 2.32,
          "abs_start": 23.59
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Convert, or die.",
          "start": 4.26,
          "dur": 1.293,
          "abs_start": 25.91
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And underneath that sentence sits a rule they are very proud of.",
          "start": 6.053,
          "dur": 4.277,
          "abs_start": 27.703
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "A faith that is forced on people never lasts.",
          "start": 10.33,
          "dur": 2.773,
          "abs_start": 31.98
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "The moment the pressure lifts, the people let it go.",
          "start": 13.103,
          "dur": 3.327,
          "abs_start": 34.753
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Remember that rule.",
          "start": 16.43,
          "dur": 1.421,
          "abs_start": 38.08
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Because today we are going to follow it all the way to the end.",
          "start": 18.251,
          "dur": 4.559,
          "abs_start": 39.901
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "And it does not lead where they think it does.",
          "start": 22.81,
          "dur": 2.49,
          "abs_start": 44.46
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/02.wav",
      "start": 48.15,
      "dur": 25.25,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 23.9,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "I am not going to tell you the rule is wrong.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 3.122,
          "abs_start": 48.49
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "The rule is true.",
          "start": 3.462,
          "dur": 1.188,
          "abs_start": 51.612
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "A faith held up by force really does fall the moment the force is gone.",
          "start": 4.65,
          "dur": 5.0,
          "abs_start": 52.8
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "So the only honest question left is this one.",
          "start": 9.65,
          "dur": 3.52,
          "abs_start": 57.8
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "In all of history, which faith was actually spread that way?",
          "start": 13.17,
          "dur": 3.987,
          "abs_start": 61.32
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Not which one was accused of it.",
          "start": 17.157,
          "dur": 2.633,
          "abs_start": 65.307
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Which one was really built on the blade.",
          "start": 19.79,
          "dur": 2.53,
          "abs_start": 67.94
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Let us go and look.",
          "start": 22.32,
          "dur": 1.58,
          "abs_start": 70.47
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/03.wav",
      "start": 73.4,
      "dur": 23.025,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 21.96,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Go back to Rome.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.27,
          "abs_start": 73.74
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "For three hundred years Rome ruled the lands around the Mediterranean.",
          "start": 1.61,
          "dur": 4.21,
          "abs_start": 75.01
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Syria, Egypt, across North Africa to the edge of Morocco, up into Anatolia.",
          "start": 5.82,
          "dur": 6.733,
          "abs_start": 79.22
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And once the empire took one faith as its own, that faith became the law.",
          "start": 12.553,
          "dur": 4.597,
          "abs_start": 85.953
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Not an invitation.",
          "start": 17.15,
          "dur": 1.63,
          "abs_start": 90.55
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "A command, carried by the power of the state.",
          "start": 18.78,
          "dur": 3.18,
          "abs_start": 92.18
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/04.wav",
      "start": 96.425,
      "dur": 29.35,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 28.02,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And if your belief was not theirs, you learned what that meant.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 3.31,
          "abs_start": 96.765
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "The Jews knew it first.",
          "start": 3.65,
          "dur": 1.72,
          "abs_start": 100.075
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Taxed, pushed out, driven from city after city, blamed for whatever the empire needed blamed.",
          "start": 5.37,
          "dur": 6.834,
          "abs_start": 101.795
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And they were not alone.",
          "start": 12.204,
          "dur": 1.602,
          "abs_start": 108.629
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Anyone who would not take the official faith, other Christians, old believers, whole peoples, lived under the same shadow.",
          "start": 13.806,
          "dur": 7.731,
          "abs_start": 110.231
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Baptism, or ruin.",
          "start": 21.537,
          "dur": 1.277,
          "abs_start": 117.962
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "This is what a forced faith actually looks like.",
          "start": 23.214,
          "dur": 2.995,
          "abs_start": 119.639
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Not a story.",
          "start": 26.209,
          "dur": 0.941,
          "abs_start": 122.634
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "A boot.",
          "start": 27.15,
          "dur": 0.87,
          "abs_start": 123.575
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/05.wav",
      "start": 125.775,
      "dur": 32.125,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 31.08,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now hold that picture, because here is the part they never tell you.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 3.67,
          "abs_start": 126.095
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "When the Muslims came to those same lands, Syria, Egypt, across to Morocco, the people did not meet them as conquerors to be feared.",
          "start": 3.99,
          "dur": 8.498,
          "abs_start": 129.765
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "For many of them, it was relief.",
          "start": 12.488,
          "dur": 2.375,
          "abs_start": 138.263
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The weight they had carried under Rome, the taxes for believing wrong, the choice of convert or suffer, that weight lifted.",
          "start": 14.863,
          "dur": 7.307,
          "abs_start": 140.638
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "The Jews who had been hunted found, under Muslim rule, a place they could live, pray, and breathe.",
          "start": 22.17,
          "dur": 5.14,
          "abs_start": 147.945
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Ask the Jews.",
          "start": 27.31,
          "dur": 1.101,
          "abs_start": 153.085
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Read the history.",
          "start": 28.411,
          "dur": 1.334,
          "abs_start": 154.186
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "It is written down.",
          "start": 29.746,
          "dur": 1.334,
          "abs_start": 155.521
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/06.wav",
      "start": 157.9,
      "dur": 35.95,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 34.48,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And here is why it felt like relief.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 2.487,
          "abs_start": 158.24
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Under Muslim rule, you were not forced to become Muslim.",
          "start": 2.827,
          "dur": 4.145,
          "abs_start": 160.727
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The Christian who wanted to stay Christian, stayed Christian.",
          "start": 6.972,
          "dur": 3.643,
          "abs_start": 164.872
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The Jew kept his synagogue.",
          "start": 10.615,
          "dur": 1.985,
          "abs_start": 168.515
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "The churches stayed open.",
          "start": 12.599,
          "dur": 1.733,
          "abs_start": 170.499
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "The law was clear.",
          "start": 14.333,
          "dur": 1.231,
          "abs_start": 172.233
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Faith is not something you hammer into a person.",
          "start": 15.564,
          "dur": 3.743,
          "abs_start": 173.464
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "No human can place belief in a heart.",
          "start": 19.307,
          "dur": 2.738,
          "abs_start": 177.207
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Guidance is from Allah alone.",
          "start": 22.045,
          "dur": 2.236,
          "abs_start": 179.945
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "So the Muslims did not try to do Allah's work with a sword.",
          "start": 24.281,
          "dur": 3.709,
          "abs_start": 182.181
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "They carried the message, lived it honestly, dealt justly, and left the hearts to Allah.",
          "start": 27.99,
          "dur": 6.49,
          "abs_start": 185.89
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/07.wav",
      "start": 193.85,
      "dur": 29.825,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 28.62,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And so it stood.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.11,
          "abs_start": 194.19
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Not for a year.",
          "start": 1.45,
          "dur": 1.26,
          "abs_start": 195.3
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Not for a generation.",
          "start": 2.71,
          "dur": 1.55,
          "abs_start": 196.56
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "For centuries.",
          "start": 4.26,
          "dur": 1.26,
          "abs_start": 198.11
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "These lands were ruled by Muslims for hundreds and hundreds of years.",
          "start": 5.52,
          "dur": 3.52,
          "abs_start": 199.37
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Long enough for empires to rise and fall.",
          "start": 9.04,
          "dur": 2.49,
          "abs_start": 202.89
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Long enough that if Islam were truly nothing but a sword held to the throat, the proof would be everywhere.",
          "start": 11.53,
          "dur": 6.61,
          "abs_start": 205.38
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Instead, over all those generations, people came to it freely, at their own pace, family by family, because of what they saw, not because of what they were threatened with.",
          "start": 18.14,
          "dur": 10.48,
          "abs_start": 211.99
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/08.wav",
      "start": 223.675,
      "dur": 39.175,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 37.82,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Then, about a thousand years later, the tide turned the other way.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 4.964,
          "abs_start": 224.015
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Now it was Europe that marched out.",
          "start": 5.304,
          "dur": 2.573,
          "abs_start": 228.979
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "And this time the sword was real, and it was aimed straight at the faith.",
          "start": 7.878,
          "dur": 4.549,
          "abs_start": 231.553
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It began with Spain.",
          "start": 12.426,
          "dur": 1.534,
          "abs_start": 236.101
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Then the British, the Dutch, the French.",
          "start": 13.96,
          "dur": 2.58,
          "abs_start": 237.635
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Across North Africa.",
          "start": 16.54,
          "dur": 1.838,
          "abs_start": 240.215
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Into Indonesia.",
          "start": 18.378,
          "dur": 1.793,
          "abs_start": 242.053
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Into the Balkans, into Bosnia.",
          "start": 20.172,
          "dur": 2.418,
          "abs_start": 243.847
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "For centuries their flags flew over the Muslim world.",
          "start": 22.59,
          "dur": 3.924,
          "abs_start": 246.265
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And here, finally, we can test the rule.",
          "start": 26.514,
          "dur": 3.145,
          "abs_start": 250.189
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "Their own rule.",
          "start": 29.659,
          "dur": 1.014,
          "abs_start": 253.334
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "If a forced faith cannot last, then a faith crushed by five hundred years of empire should have nothing left.",
          "start": 30.672,
          "dur": 7.148,
          "abs_start": 254.347
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/09.wav",
      "start": 262.85,
      "dur": 28.65,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 27.16,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And do not imagine they were gentle.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 2.1,
          "abs_start": 263.19
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Do not tell yourself they simply ruled and let people be.",
          "start": 2.44,
          "dur": 3.62,
          "abs_start": 265.29
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "They tried to take the faith out.",
          "start": 6.06,
          "dur": 1.97,
          "abs_start": 268.91
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "They killed.",
          "start": 8.03,
          "dur": 0.731,
          "abs_start": 270.88
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "They humiliated.",
          "start": 8.761,
          "dur": 1.357,
          "abs_start": 271.611
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "They outlawed the language of the Quran in the street and the school.",
          "start": 10.118,
          "dur": 4.092,
          "abs_start": 272.968
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "They turned brother against brother so a people could not stand together.",
          "start": 14.21,
          "dur": 4.27,
          "abs_start": 277.06
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Everything an empire can do to erase a thing, they did it.",
          "start": 18.48,
          "dur": 4.12,
          "abs_start": 281.33
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "This was the sword, finally, for real.",
          "start": 22.6,
          "dur": 2.83,
          "abs_start": 285.45
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "So, did it work?",
          "start": 25.93,
          "dur": 1.23,
          "abs_start": 288.78
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/10.wav",
      "start": 291.5,
      "dur": 32.55,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 30.98,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "No.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 0.426,
          "abs_start": 291.84
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "When the empires finally packed up and left, after everything, the faith was still there.",
          "start": 1.266,
          "dur": 5.857,
          "abs_start": 292.766
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Indonesia, after centuries of foreign rule, walked into independence and remained what it was, the largest Muslim nation on earth.",
          "start": 7.124,
          "dur": 8.796,
          "abs_start": 298.624
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Bosnia, surrounded, hunted, marked for erasure in the very heart of Europe, still standing, still praying, still here.",
          "start": 15.92,
          "dur": 7.62,
          "abs_start": 307.42
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Across North Africa, independence came after the Second World War, and the people who emerged were the same people who went in.",
          "start": 23.54,
          "dur": 7.44,
          "abs_start": 315.04
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/11.wav",
      "start": 324.05,
      "dur": 27.8,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 26.7,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Look at it plainly.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 1.26,
          "abs_start": 324.37
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Count the believers in those lands before the colonisers came.",
          "start": 1.58,
          "dur": 3.72,
          "abs_start": 325.63
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Count them after they left.",
          "start": 5.3,
          "dur": 1.36,
          "abs_start": 329.35
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The number barely moves.",
          "start": 6.66,
          "dur": 2.08,
          "abs_start": 330.71
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Hundreds of years of the most powerful empires in history, with every weapon and every school and every law turned against one single thing, and they could not shift it.",
          "start": 8.74,
          "dur": 10.03,
          "abs_start": 332.79
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Because you cannot conquer what does not live in the land.",
          "start": 18.77,
          "dur": 3.33,
          "abs_start": 342.82
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "It lived in the heart.",
          "start": 22.1,
          "dur": 1.66,
          "abs_start": 346.15
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And no army has ever taken a heart.",
          "start": 24.16,
          "dur": 2.54,
          "abs_start": 348.21
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/12.wav",
      "start": 351.85,
      "dur": 27.375,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 25.96,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So let us go back to their rule.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 2.41,
          "abs_start": 352.17
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A forced faith never lasts.",
          "start": 2.73,
          "dur": 1.98,
          "abs_start": 354.58
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The moment the force is gone, the people let it go.",
          "start": 4.71,
          "dur": 2.97,
          "abs_start": 356.56
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "They are right.",
          "start": 7.68,
          "dur": 0.95,
          "abs_start": 359.53
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "That rule is true.",
          "start": 8.63,
          "dur": 1.53,
          "abs_start": 360.48
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "They just pointed it at the wrong religion.",
          "start": 10.16,
          "dur": 2.5,
          "abs_start": 362.01
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Because the faith that was forced, in Rome, across Europe, convert or be ruined, look at those same lands today.",
          "start": 12.66,
          "dur": 7.74,
          "abs_start": 364.51
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "The churches stand empty.",
          "start": 20.4,
          "dur": 2.06,
          "abs_start": 372.25
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "A whole continent has quietly walked away from God.",
          "start": 22.46,
          "dur": 3.5,
          "abs_start": 374.31
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 13,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/13.wav",
      "start": 379.225,
      "dur": 38.225,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 36.8,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And ask yourself honestly why.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.94,
          "abs_start": 379.565
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "It is not an accident.",
          "start": 2.28,
          "dur": 2.39,
          "abs_start": 381.505
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "When a faith is pressed onto people by force, generation after generation, it leaves a wound.",
          "start": 4.67,
          "dur": 6.4,
          "abs_start": 383.895
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And a wounded people do not just leave one faith.",
          "start": 11.07,
          "dur": 2.844,
          "abs_start": 390.295
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "They grow a quiet aversion to faith itself.",
          "start": 13.913,
          "dur": 2.517,
          "abs_start": 393.138
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "That is what you see in Europe now.",
          "start": 16.43,
          "dur": 2.693,
          "abs_start": 395.655
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Not only an empty church.",
          "start": 19.123,
          "dur": 1.888,
          "abs_start": 398.348
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "A reflex of pushing religion away, because somewhere in their history religion arrived as a hand around the throat.",
          "start": 21.011,
          "dur": 8.319,
          "abs_start": 400.236
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Their rule came true, in their own home, on their own faith.",
          "start": 29.33,
          "dur": 3.533,
          "abs_start": 408.555
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "That is not something to laugh at.",
          "start": 32.863,
          "dur": 2.337,
          "abs_start": 412.088
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "It is the proof.",
          "start": 35.2,
          "dur": 1.2,
          "abs_start": 414.425
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 14,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/14.wav",
      "start": 417.45,
      "dur": 28.025,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 26.5,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And ours?",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 0.72,
          "abs_start": 417.79
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Ours was never forced.",
          "start": 1.06,
          "dur": 1.68,
          "abs_start": 418.51
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "It came as relief after cruelty.",
          "start": 2.74,
          "dur": 2.47,
          "abs_start": 420.19
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It was chosen freely, over centuries, in lands where you were free to refuse it.",
          "start": 5.21,
          "dur": 5.3,
          "abs_start": 422.66
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And when the real sword finally came, not to spread it, but to destroy it, it did not fall.",
          "start": 10.51,
          "dur": 6.66,
          "abs_start": 427.96
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "They forced their faith and lost it.",
          "start": 17.17,
          "dur": 1.919,
          "abs_start": 434.62
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "We were given ours freely, and we kept it.",
          "start": 19.089,
          "dur": 3.068,
          "abs_start": 436.539
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "The same rule.",
          "start": 22.156,
          "dur": 0.924,
          "abs_start": 439.606
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Two opposite endings.",
          "start": 23.08,
          "dur": 1.83,
          "abs_start": 440.53
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "That is the whole story.",
          "start": 24.91,
          "dur": 1.59,
          "abs_start": 442.36
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 15,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/15.wav",
      "start": 445.475,
      "dur": 31.45,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 29.84,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So the next time someone tells you your faith was spread by the sword, you do not need to raise your voice.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 5.85,
          "abs_start": 445.795
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You know the history now.",
          "start": 6.17,
          "dur": 1.63,
          "abs_start": 451.645
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You know whose hand actually held the blade, and what it cost them.",
          "start": 7.8,
          "dur": 3.52,
          "abs_start": 453.275
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The truth never needed a sword.",
          "start": 11.32,
          "dur": 2.26,
          "abs_start": 456.795
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It only ever needed to be seen.",
          "start": 13.58,
          "dur": 2.09,
          "abs_start": 459.055
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "That is why, after Rome, after empires, after five hundred years of everything they could throw at it, we are still here.",
          "start": 16.07,
          "dur": 7.811,
          "abs_start": 461.545
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And every single time you rise to pray, you are the living proof that the truth never needed a sword.",
          "start": 23.881,
          "dur": 5.959,
          "abs_start": 469.356
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 16,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/ummaunited/voice/sword/man/16.wav",
      "start": 476.925,
      "dur": 27.925,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 26.4,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "This is what we do here.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.53,
          "abs_start": 477.265
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "We show you the other side of the story, the one you were never handed.",
          "start": 1.87,
          "dur": 5.009,
          "abs_start": 478.795
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Because a lie has to travel in crooked lines.",
          "start": 6.879,
          "dur": 3.361,
          "abs_start": 483.804
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It has to bend the facts, hide half of them, and hope you never check.",
          "start": 10.24,
          "dur": 4.17,
          "abs_start": 487.165
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "The truth does not need any of that.",
          "start": 14.41,
          "dur": 2.468,
          "abs_start": 491.335
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "The truth runs straight.",
          "start": 16.878,
          "dur": 1.082,
          "abs_start": 493.803
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "So if you are tired of being told to feel small about who you are, stay with us.",
          "start": 17.96,
          "dur": 5.22,
          "abs_start": 494.885
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Follow Umma United, and hold your head high.",
          "start": 23.18,
          "dur": 3.22,
          "abs_start": 500.105
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
